        "IgM monoclonal protein >3 g/dL",
        "Bone marrow lymphoplasmacytic infiltrate",
        "Hyperviscosity syndrome"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "redFlags": [
    "Rapidly progressive glomerulonephritis",
    "Digital gangrene or severe skin ulceration",
    "Worsening neuropathy with motor deficits",
    "Signs of B-cell lymphoma transformation (rapidly enlarging lymph nodes, rising monoclonal protein)",
    "Severe hypocomplementemia with organ damage"
  ],
